{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q412938","formula":"Be₃Sc₂(Si₆O₁₈)","hill":"Be3O18Sc2Si6","elements":["Be","O","Si","Sc"],"composition":{"O":18.0,"Be":3.0,"Sc":2.0,"Si":6.0},"names":{"en":"Bazzite","uk":"Бацит"},"descriptions":{"en":"Bazzite is a beryllium scandium cyclosilicate mineral with chemical formula Be3Sc2Si6O18 (Be3(Sc,Fe)2Si6O18 or Be3(Sc,Al)2Si6O18). It crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system typically as small blue hexagonal crystals up to 2 cm length. It has a Mohs hardness of 6.5–7 and a specific gravity of 2.77 to 2.85.","uk":"Бацит — мінерал, циклосилікат берилію та скандію з хімічною формулою Be3Sc2Si6O18 (Be3(Sc,Fe)2Si6O18 або Be3(Sc,Al)2Si6O18). Кристалізується в гексагональній кристалічній системі, як правило, у вигляді маленьких блакитних гексагональних кристалів до 2 см довжини. Має твердість за Моосом 6,5–7 і питому вагу від 2,77 до 2,85."},"fame":16,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q412938","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bazzite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bazzite_-_Fibbia_Ticino_Switzerland.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0 de"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q58959","formula":"Be₃Al₂Si₅O₁₈","names":{"en":"Aquamarine","ru":"Аквамарин","uk":"Аквамарин"},"elements":["Be","O","Al","Si"],"fame":67,"kind":null},{"id":"Q19833496","formula":"CaScAlSiO₆","names":{"en":"Davisite","uk":"Дейвісит"},"elements":["O","Al","Si","Ca","Sc"],"fame":9,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q10